      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It looks like it dropped something as it left.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 4964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900740020006C006F006F006B00730020006C0069006B0065002000690074002000640072006F007000700065006400200073006F006D0065007400680069006E00670020006100730020006900740020006C006500660074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You can sense more Cofagrigus still lurking\naround the sewer.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 5060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002000630061006E002000730065006E007300650020006D006F0072006500200043006F006600610067007200690067007500730020007300740069006C006C0020006C00750072006B0069006E0067000A00610072006F0075006E00640020007400680065002000730065007700650072002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿6",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 5184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s so bright out here!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 5196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900742019007300200073006F00200062007200690067006800740020006F0075007400200068006500720065002100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you all right?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 5256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072006500200079006F007500200061006C006C002000720069006700680074003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What happened?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 5296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074002000680061007000700065006E00650064003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, uh...well, to tell you the truth, I got pretty\nexcited when I found a Cofagrigus down here.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nYou never see ’em in Lumiose!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 5328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I let out a big whoop of excitement, and I think\nthe noise ticked Cofagrigus off.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 5596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So it got mad and swallowed me up.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 5768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F00200069007400200067006F00740020006D0061006400200061006E00640020007300770061006C006C006F0077006500640020006D0065002000750070002E00100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thing is, it was just so darn comfy in there, I\ndozed off. I think I was about to hit REM mode.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 5848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So, I’m a little embarrassed, but thanks for\nbusting me out!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 6048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F002C002000492019006D002000610020006C006900740074006C006500200065006D006200610072007200610073007300650064002C00200062007500740020007400680061006E006B007300200066006F0072000A00620075007300740069006E00670020006D00650020006F00750074002100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Whoever I heard screaming might be shut up in\none of those Cofagrigus...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou gotta go take care of ’em all!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 6180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 115
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿@",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 6412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, good work!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 6424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002C00200067006F006F006400200077006F0072006B0021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Guess we found our screamer. Glad you’re all\nright, fella.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 6464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007500650073007300200077006500200066006F0075006E00640020006F00750072002000730063007200650061006D00650072002E00200047006C0061006400200079006F007520190072006500200061006C006C000A00720069006700680074002C002000660065006C006C0061002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Look at you, helping keep the peace around\nLumiose again. Another feather in your cap!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 6592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "’Course, you never would’ve had the chance if I\nhadn’t flagged you down. Feel free to thank me.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 6776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uh, behind you...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 6976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550068002C00200062006500680069006E006400200079006F0075002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t get swallowed",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 7012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E2019007400200067006500740020007300770061006C006C006F0077006500640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Huh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 7052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800750068003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "GYAAAH!!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 7072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700590041004100410048002100210021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
